ghostty (1.4.0ppa2) stonking; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.4.0
  * Bundle Zig 0.17.0 (replaces Zig 0.15.2) and vendor dependencies in
    zig-pkg/ (zig build --fetch=all) for offline --system builds
  * Build-Depends: add libegl-dev; require GTK >= 4.18, libadwaita >= 1.7
    and gtk4-layer-shell >= 1.0.4
  * Set -Dinstalled-exe-path=/usr/bin/ghostty
  * libghostty-vt-dev: ship the full header tree and the static library

 -- Avenge Media <AvengeMedia.US@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:09:05 -0400

